-- Killaloe field spawns for zone 253 (Abermenai region, Killaloe terrain).
-- Source: OpenDAoC-Database opendaoc-db-core/mob.sql, every Mob whose Region is 237
-- (https://github.com/OpenDAoC/OpenDAoC-Database, GPL-3). 74 rows.
-- Retail Killaloe is zone 237 at sector offset 64,64; this world dropped that offset,
-- so each X and Y is source minus 524288 (64*8192). Region is stored as 253.
-- Z, heading, level, name, model and the rest of the source columns are unchanged.
-- PackageID marks these as Setup-authored so Classic 1.65 leftover checks skip them.
-- Loot templates are not invented here; they stay on the world's existing name-keyed tables.

